.TH OPENCARDSHOP 1 "November 2026" "OpenCardShop @VERSION@" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
opencardshop \- design, personalise and print folded greeting cards
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B opencardshop
.RI [ CARD ]
.br
.B opencardshop
.I CARD
.B \-\-export
.IR OUTPUT .pdf|.png
.RI [ options ]
.br
.B opencardshop \-\-test\-page \-\-fold
.BR side | top | full
.B \-\-export
.IR OUTPUT .pdf
.SH DESCRIPTION
OpenCardShop is an offline greeting-card editor. It opens saved
.I .occard
cards and original CardShop Plus
.I .CMK
cards, and prints quarter-fold cards on one side of a single A4, Letter or Legal sheet.
.PP
An open starter pack (clipart, fonts, messages and ready-made cards) is included, and
the fonts installed on the computer are offered. Pictures, messages and designs saved
to \fBMy library\fR are kept per user and can be used in every card.
CardShop Plus content is not included; choose your own CD with
\fBFile \(-> Open another asset folder\fR.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-export " FILE"
Export the card to PDF (the folded print sheet) or PNG (one side) without opening a window.
.TP
.BR \-\-side " front|inside|back"
Side to export as PNG.
.TP
.BR \-\-paper " A4|Letter|Legal"
Paper size; defaults to the card's saved setting.
.TP
.BI \-\-margin " MM"
One minimum margin for all four edges.
.TP
.BI \-\-margins " LEFT RIGHT TOP BOTTOM"
Four minimum margins in millimetres.
.TP
.B \-\-guides
Include numbered fold guides.
.TP
.BR \-\-layout " quarter|half"
\fBquarter\fR: all faces on one side of the sheet, folded twice.
\fBhalf\fR: a two-page PDF (back and front, then the inside) for two-sided printing with
flip on short edge, folded once. Defaults to the card's saved setting.
.TP
.B \-\-rotate\-side\-2
With \fB\-\-layout half\fR, turn side 2 upside down for printers that need it.
.TP
.B \-\-test\-page
Export a marked folding and printer test sheet.
.TP
.BI \-\-assets " FOLDER"
Use CardShop Plus content from FOLDER (the folder containing CARDSHOP.INI).
.TP
.BI \-\-dpi " N"
Export resolution, 36 to 600 (default 300).
.TP
.B \-\-version
Show the version.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/opencardshop/my\-library/
My library: art/, cards/ and messages.json.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/opencardshop/cardshop/
An optional place for extracted CardShop Plus CD content.
.TP
.I ~/.config/opencardshop/settings.json
The CardShop Plus folder chosen last time.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B OPENCARDSHOP_HOME
Keep settings, My library and caches in this one folder instead.
.TP
.B OPENCARDSHOP_NO_SYSTEM_FONTS
When set, offer only bundled fonts.
.TP
.B OPENCARDSHOP_PYTHON
Python interpreter used by the launcher.
.SH PRINTING
Print at Actual size / 100% with scaling turned off. The quarter layout prints one-sided and
folds twice at the centre lines. The half layout prints two-sided with flip on short edge
(lp \-o sides=two\-sided\-short\-edge) and folds once.
